      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Literally this, I dont understand why a permanent and horribly designed HUD is being forced onto players was ever considered to be a good idea let alone functional? It takes away from the social experience when your screen is PERMANENTLY blocked by buttons and icons you dont need to see, not to mention how buggy it is.",
