      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c9bfccf37d9d113629fc658|full_name} They don't like scrapping what makes the investors think they're innovating. They gotta look busy after all. But really, this hud is quite the mess. Almost 10 days after this post, nothing substantial has changed and once again, when we all say \"Hey maybe don't...?\" they keep pressing forward anyway. \n\nAnd that's given all we ever asked for was buttons to disable these changes so we can have peace of mind knowing whoever actually likes the changes can have them and the rest of us can enjoy VRC in peace.",
